{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-40","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-40-talk-403815052-line","text":"某天王摇滚巨星粉丝，向你递出他珍藏已久的原声大碟。里面有数十种不同的声音。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-40-talk-403815053-line","text":"「最多噪音的摇滚、最神圣古典的说唱、最时髦的复古元素、最炫彩的朴素装饰音！星际潮玩美食、新推出的说谎游戏纯享奏乐、时代多重大混搭的珍藏大碟！」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-40-talk-403815054-line","text":"你恶狠狠地想着——他看上去一定隶属于矛盾元素组织！","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-40-text-8044055931432756978-choice","text":"听一听。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-40-text-1635461589949236324-choice","text":"不听。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-40-text-16234517876940128951-effect","text":"不要倾听那些具有蛊惑力的曲子…","speaker":""}]}
